  "description": "Explore photos of tropical plants and nursery facilities at Machin Nursery Farms in Homestead, Florida. Contact us for plant availability.",
  "main": "<main id=\"main-content\"><nav class=\"container breadcrumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> / <span aria-current=\"page\">Gallery</span></nav>\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>Machin Nursery Farms Gallery</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">View photos of our tropical plant inventory, nursery facilities in South Florida.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"container section\">\n      <h2>Tropical Plant Inventory</h2>\n      <p>Our retail nursery features a curated selection of tropical plants, privacy hedges, and ornamental trees adapted to South Florida climate. Visit to explore live plant specimens, discuss species options with our team, and select plants for your landscaping project.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"container section alt\">\n      <h2>Support for Your Landscape Project</h2>\n      <p>Explore photographs of the nursery and its plants. Contact our team to discuss plant selection, delivery, or installation for your project.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"container section\">\n      <h2>Visit Our Nursery</h2>\n      <p>To see our complete plant inventory in person, visit our main retail location during business hours. Our team can provide hands-on recommendations, explain specific plant characteristics, and help you select the right specimens for your yard or landscape project.</p>\n      <p><strong>Main Location:</strong> 30760 SW 212 Ave, Homestead, FL 33030<br>\n      <strong>Hours:</strong> Monday–Saturday, 7:00 AM–5:00 PM; Sunday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM</p>\n    </section>\n  <section class=\"container section\"><h2>Nursery photographs</h2><div class=\"cards gallery-grid\"><figure class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/images/nursery-01.jpg\" alt=\"Plants at the nursery\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Plants at the nursery</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/images/nursery-02.jpg\" alt=\"Tropical plant selection\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Tropical plant selection</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/images/nursery-03.jpg\" alt=\"Nursery plants and trees\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Nursery plants and trees</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/images/nursery-04.jpg\" alt=\"Ornamental plants\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Ornamental plants</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/images/nursery-05.jpg\" alt=\"Nursery plant varieties\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Nursery plant varieties</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"card\"><img src=\"/assets/images/nursery-06.jpg\" alt=\"Plants at the nursery\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Plants at the nursery</figcaption></figure></div></section></main>",
